## STACK

| Layer       | Technology                                      |
|-------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| Frontend    | Remix + Cloudflare Pages (apps/web)             |
| API         | Hono on Cloudflare Workers (apps/worker)        |
| Database    | Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) — pivot-parlor-db        |
| Cache       | Cloudflare KV                                   |
| Auth        | JWT + KV sessions, roles: developer/admin/staff/customer |
| Payments    | Stripe Connect Express, Destination Charges, 10% commission |
| AI          | OpenRouter API (OPENROUTER_API_KEY)             |
| CSS         | Tailwind v3 + PostCSS (NOT v4 — breaks on CF Pages) |
| Monorepo    | Turborepo, npm workspaces                       |

