## DIRECTORY STRUCTURE

```
pivot-parlor/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/                        ← Remix frontend (Cloudflare Pages)
│   │   ├── app/
│   │   │   ├── routes/             ← All Remix routes
│   │   │   ├── components/
│   │   │   │   ├── ui/             ← Button, Input, Dialog, Badge, Card
│   │   │   │   ├── marketing/      ← Navbar, Footer, MarketingChatbot, etc.
│   │   │   │   └── dashboards/     ← DashboardLayout, Sidebar
│   │   │   ├── lib/
│   │   │   │   ├── auth.ts         ← requireRole, getSessionToken
│   │   │   │   └── api.ts          ← createApiClient
│   │   │   └── root.tsx            ← Layout, PlatformCookieBanner
│   │   ├── wrangler.toml           ← Pages config, project-name: pivot-parlor-web
│   │   └── .dev.vars               ← Local secrets (gitignored)
│   └── worker/
│       ├── src/
│       │   ├── routes/             ← Hono route files
│       │   ├── db/
│       │   │   ├── schema.sql      ← Master schema
│       │   │   ├── queries.ts      ← All DB query helpers
│       │   │   └── migrations/     ← Sequential SQL migration files (001–011)
│       │   ├── middleware/
│       │   │   ├── auth.ts         ← authMiddleware
│       │   │   └── rbac.ts         ← requireShop, requireRole
│       │   └── index.ts            ← Hono app entry, all routes registered
│       └── wrangler.toml           ← Worker config, name: pivot-parlor-api
└── packages/
    ├── types/                      ← Shared TS types (@repo/types)
    └── utils/                      ← Shared utils (@repo/utils)
```

