## COMPONENT CONVENTIONS

### UI components available (use these — don't create new ones)
- `~/components/ui/Button` — variants: default, outline, ghost, destructive, secondary, link
- `~/components/ui/Input` — props: label, error
- `~/components/ui/Dialog` — DialogContent, DialogHeader, DialogTitle, DialogTrigger
- `~/components/ui/Badge`
- `~/components/ui/Card`

### Design system
- Fonts: Playfair Display (headings), DM Sans (body)
- Colors: gold (#C9A84C, gold-light #E2C47A, gold-dark #A8872E), dark (#0D0D0D, dark-100 #1a1a1a, dark-200 #2a2a2a)
- Background: dark (#0D0D0D), text: white
- All dashboards use DashboardLayout + Sidebar
- Sidebar ADMIN_NAV: Overview, Staff, Services, Schedule, Bookings, Revenue, Settings

### Brand rules
- NEVER use em-dashes (— or --) in any user-facing text. Use two sentences instead.
- Gold gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C 0%, #E2C47A 100%)
- All marketing pages use dark background with gold accents

