## SECRETS MANAGEMENT

### Web (Cloudflare Pages)
Set with: `npx wrangler pages secret put SECRET_NAME --project-name pivot-parlor-web`
NEVER use `wrangler secret put` for the web project — that is Workers-only and will error.

Current Pages secrets: JWT_SECRET, OPENROUTER_API_KEY

### Worker (Cloudflare Workers)
Set with: `npx wrangler secret put SECRET_NAME` (from apps/worker directory)

Current Worker secrets: JWT_SECRET, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET

### Local dev (.dev.vars — gitignored)
```
API_URL=http://localhost:8787
APP_DOMAIN=localhost
JWT_SECRET=dev-secret-change-in-production
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-your-key-here
