## PRICING & BUSINESS RULES

- Setup fee: £100 one-time (covers onboarding, training, AI site generation)
- Commission: 10% on completed bookings only
- No monthly fees
- Stripe Connect Express accounts per shop
- Destination Charges model — platform takes 10% application_fee_amount
- Walk-in bookings: no deposit, QR queue
- Setup gate: staff + services + Stripe Connect + address required before go-live
- EOD dev alert: booking count only, no amounts

