## MARKETING CHATBOT (Pip)

- Component: `apps/web/app/components/marketing/MarketingChatbot.tsx`
- API route: `apps/web/app/routes/api.chat.tsx`
- Models: google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview (primary), google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite (fallback)
- max_tokens: 180
- System prompt enforces: 3 lines max per reply, no bullet points, no em-dashes
- Uses OPENROUTER_API_KEY (Pages secret)
- Colours: gold/dark brand palette — NEVER use blue or any non-brand colour
- Launcher icon: custom PipIcon SVG (scissors motif) — NEVER use FB Messenger or any third-party icon
- Quick reply chips use flex-wrap to prevent truncation

