## QUALITY GATES (run before reporting any task complete)

### Gate 1 — Functional completeness
- Every file in the task exists and is non-empty
- Every new route is registered in the correct layout
- Every new Worker route is registered in index.ts

### Gate 2 — Security
- No hardcoded secrets anywhere
- All Worker mutations verify auth before processing
- No raw string interpolation in SQL

### Gate 3 — Database integrity
- New tables have a migration file numbered sequentially from 012
- All required non-nullable fields included in INSERTs

### Gate 4 — Deployment readiness
- No TypeScript errors
- New Cloudflare bindings declared in wrangler.toml
- No Node.js-specific modules (fs, path) in Worker code

### Gate 5 — Brand compliance
- No em-dashes in any user-facing text
- No blue colours in marketing chatbot or marketing components — gold/dark only
- Pricing copy always states £100 setup + 10% commission + no monthly fees

### Gate 6 — Code quality
- No duplicate logic
- No unused imports
- All async functions have try/catch
- API responses follow { success, data?, error? } envelope

Report format when all gates pass:
- Files created/modified
- Any manual steps needed (migrations, secrets)
- Confirmation: "All quality gates passed"
